'''Rocker Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9]] increases health and attack power. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]].

