==Trivia==
*The line, "An authentic craftsman who keeps telling amateurs to shut up," (素人は黙っとれが口癖の本格派職人) in Ramen Cat's Japanese description is a reference to "Amateurs, shut up," (素人は黙っとれ), a Japanese Internet meme associated with TOKIO leader [[wikipedia:Shigeru Joshima|Shigeru Joshima]].
*In his [[Upgrade Menu]] icon, Ramen Cat's ramen is shown flying outside of his strainer, something that normally only happens when he is attacking or being knocked back.
*According to [[Media:FamCom 20150401.jpg|this 4koma]], Rocker Cat and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Mohawk Cat]] are the same Cat.
*Rocker Cat won the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wvwJQ9TSSTQ 2025 Best True Form Nyaward], with a speech accompanying his victory:
<blockquote>
How we feeling out there tonight, Cat Empire?! Lemme hear you say "NYAAAAAA"! This rockstar life takes you to some weird places, and I've had to take on a lot of side gigs. After my second record didn't sell, I learned to express myself in painting. One thing led to another, and at last, I found my calling as a ramen chef! The spirit of a true rock god ain't just about the music. Even a great noodle bowl can shake up society! All us True Forms had to learn that embracing change is the key to realizing your hidden potential! So take it from us: keep exploring, stay passionate, and you'll evolve to be the best you!
</blockquote>

